msgid "生日"
msgstr "Birthday"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "职业"
msgstr "Occupation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "灵活就业人员（以智力和文化工作为主，没有稳定的服务方，在背景设定的这个时代里，进行文化品创作和消费使用文化品本省都是一种职业，所产生的价值是可以创造数据供应给智能AI的研发），C+智力劳动职级（初入职场的年轻人通常会被评定的能力等级）"
msgstr ""
"Freelance worker (primarily engaged in intellectual and cultural work, "
"without a stable employer. In the era of this setting, creating and "
"consuming cultural products is itself a profession, and the value "
"generated can create data to supply AI research and development), C+ "
"intellectual labor grade (the competency level typically assigned to "
"young people entering the workforce)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "外貌"
msgstr "Appearance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "没有突出的特点，但在普通人中颜值也比较优秀。看起来十分年轻却又比同龄人要沉稳。通过成人仪式时接受了电子义眼的改造，可以自由改变眼瞳的颜色、大小以及瞳孔形状（电子义眼是接入VR游戏必须的人体植入设备）"
msgstr ""
"No standout features, but above-average looks among ordinary people. "
"Appears very young yet more composed than peers. Received electronic "
"prosthetic eye modification during the coming-of-age ceremony, allowing "
"free changes to iris color, size, and pupil shape (electronic prosthetic "
"eyes are a required human implant for accessing VR games)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "头发"
msgstr "Hair"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "女黑色长发，比较自然的散发造型"
msgstr "Long black hair for female, naturally loose hairstyle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "体格"
msgstr "Build"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "身高165cm，体重46kg"
msgstr "Height 165cm, Weight 46kg"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "服装"
msgstr "Clothing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "极简风日常穿搭，穿搭上没有多余饰物"
msgstr "Minimalist daily wear, no unnecessary accessories"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "性格"
msgstr "Personality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "温良俭让，不卑不亢。乐于与不同主张和想法的人交流，愿意努力理解和接纳不同的想法"
msgstr ""
"Gentle, kind, frugal, and yielding, neither humble nor arrogant. Enjoys "
"communicating with people of different views and ideas, willing to strive"
" to understand and accept different perspectives"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "特技"
msgstr "Special Skill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "擅长与他人分享自己的知识和技能。知道怎么接纳别人的缺点，一起共事的时候很擅长安抚或是鼓舞他人"
msgstr ""
"Skilled at sharing knowledge and abilities with others. Knows how to "
"accept others' shortcomings, and excels at comforting or inspiring others"
" when working together"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "弱点"
msgstr "Weakness"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "在社会化扶养机制下，自出生就背负着的巨大贷款压力，谈钱色变"
msgstr ""
"Under the socialized child-rearing system, has borne enormous loan "
"pressure since birth, turns pale at the mention of money"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "口吻"
msgstr "Speech Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid "比较理性和冷静。与竞争者谈判时：“虽然想法与做法不同，但我们利益是一致的，更应该互相理解与合作不是吗？”"
msgstr ""
"Relatively rational and calm. When negotiating with competitors: "
"\"Although our ideas and methods differ, our interests are aligned. "
"Shouldn't we understand and cooperate with each other?\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "故事设定"
msgstr "Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:7
msgid ""
"主角是通过社会性扶养系统养育的人类，记忆中一直有父母的陪伴，成年后通过参加世界认知的课程了解到陪伴自己的虚拟父母与真实父母的差别，以及被告知人生存在就是向社会贡献自己的智力资源的主流价值。最开始对自己的人生目标并没有太多思考，在媒体的宣传下购买了时下流行的游戏产品，通过暂时封闭现实记忆后进行虚拟世界游戏的游玩。直到在游戏中发现世界运行机制对人类存有的恶意后，决心加入集合众智的沧陵（沧桑陵谷）基金会支持的项目“World"
" Update Project”，并和组织成员一起自称“刍狗”，开始寻找对抗世界不公的方法"
msgstr ""
"The protagonist is a human raised through the socialized child-rearing "
"system, with memories of always having their parents' company. After "
"coming of age, through world-awareness courses, they learned the "
"difference between the virtual parents who accompanied them and real "
"parents, and were told the mainstream value that one's existence is about"
" contributing intellectual resources to society. Initially without much "
"thought about life goals, they purchased a popular game product under "
"media promotion, playing the virtual world game after temporarily sealing"
" real-world memories. Upon discovering in the game the world's operating "
"mechanism harboring malice toward humanity, they resolved to join the "
"\"World Update Project\" supported by the Cangling Foundation (an "
"organization gathering collective wisdom), and together with other "
"members calling themselves \"Chugou\" (Straw Dogs), began seeking ways to"
" fight against the world's injustices"

