#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "玩家设置，随着剧情发展也以“辅导员”、“教员”和“导师”进行称呼"
msgstr ""
"Player setting, also referred to as \"Counselor\", \"Instructor\", and "
"\"Mentor\" as the story progresses"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "玩家选择，男/女"
msgstr "Player choice, Male/Female"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "人类反抗组织军事学院任职教师"
msgstr "Teacher at the human resistance organization's military academy"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "基本同现实人设，没有突出的特点，但在普通人中颜值也比较优秀，看起来十分年轻却又比同龄人要沉稳。眼瞳为黑色及正常形状"
msgstr ""
"Basically same as real world setting, no standout features but above-"
"average looks among ordinary people, appears very young yet more composed"
" than peers. Eyes are black with normal shape"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "同现实人设，黑色长发（男式/女式），偏职业风比较干练的发型(束发造型)"
msgstr ""
"Same as real world setting, long black hair (male/female style), "
"professional and neat hairstyle (tied-up style)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "同现实人设，女身高165cm，体重46kg；男身高175cm，体重61kg"
msgstr ""
"Same as real world setting, Female: height 165cm, weight 46kg; Male: "
"height 175cm, weight 61kg"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "马丁靴（女长筒/男短靴） + 迷彩特种兵裤（口袋+金属饰物） + 无修T恤 + 夹克外套 + 黄色袖章（写有汉字“师”） + 中国风图案"
msgstr ""
"Martin boots (female knee-high / male short boots) + Camo special forces "
"pants (pockets + metal accessories) + Plain T-shirt + Jacket + Yellow "
"armband (with Chinese character \"师\" meaning \"Teacher\") + Chinese-"
"style patterns"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "同现实人设，温良俭让，不卑不亢。乐于与不同主张和想法的人交流，愿意努力理解和接纳不同的想法"
msgstr ""
"Same as real world setting, gentle, kind, frugal, and yielding, neither "
"humble nor arrogant. Enjoys communicating with people of different views "
"and ideas, willing to strive to understand and accept different "
"perspectives"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "擅长对自己的战斗经验、知识和技能进行传授与分享。知道怎么接纳别人的缺点，在团队中善于安抚他人或是鼓舞士气"
msgstr ""
"Skilled at teaching and sharing combat experience, knowledge, and "
"abilities. Knows how to accept others' shortcomings, excels at comforting"
" others or boosting morale in the team"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "积极努力的外表下其实由缺乏自信的内心在支撑，常在内心中反思自己的言行，并因为太过在意学员们的成长而感到不安"
msgstr ""
"Beneath the diligent exterior lies a heart lacking self-confidence, often"
" reflecting inwardly on words and actions, feeling anxious from caring "
"too much about students' growth"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "面对表现不好的学员：“没有关系，无论谁都是从最开始什么都做不好再努力进步的，我们一起加油吧。”内心：“有我的责任，要更多的做好授课帮助他们进步。”"
msgstr ""
"To underperforming students: \"It's okay, everyone starts out not doing "
"well and then works hard to improve. Let's do our best together.\" Inner "
"thoughts: \"This is my responsibility, I need to teach better to help "
"them improve.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/char.md:29
msgid "在完成了战场教师的培训后，被安排到最危险的“人类之笼”据点的战斗学院担任教师。实际上主角担任着两个职责，一个是教育和培养战场新人，同时带领由学员组成的军事小队，策划和实施军事行动"
msgstr ""
"After completing battlefield instructor training, was assigned as a "
"teacher at the combat academy of the most dangerous stronghold, \"Cage of"
" Humanity.\" In reality, the protagonist bears two responsibilities: "
"educating and training battlefield newcomers, while leading a military "
"squad composed of students, planning and executing military operations"

